<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Feels Like a Dream</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Feels Like a Dream</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2wzZPBRZZ1klDJJVc1kv6z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.256" end="00:26.800">It feels just like a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.800" end="00:34.137">There's nothing to do just you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.137" end="00:38.299">I usually trip over things like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.299" end="00:43.224">Just glad it's not a one time kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.224" end="00:49.818">I put my heart on the line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.818" end="00:57.816">You showed me how to love with every single touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.816" end="01:05.816">Showed me everything I've never seen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.735" end="01:08.880">It feels like a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.880" end="01:10.765">And I don't want to wake up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.765" end="01:12.902">I just want to stay here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.902" end="01:14.877">Next to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.877" end="01:16.720">It's hard to believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.720" end="01:22.090">That I found someone that loves just like I do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.090" end="01:23.590">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.584" end="01:25.939">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.939" end="01:27.540">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.540" end="01:29.953">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.953" end="01:31.613">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.613" end="01:33.963">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.963" end="01:35.585">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.585" end="01:37.925">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.925" end="01:41.804">Pretty boys don't usually cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.804" end="01:45.813">But then I looked at you with a smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.813" end="01:49.115">Honestly I thought you'd be far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.115" end="01:53.031">Your closer than I thought, thought</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.031" end="01:56.581">We dance in the sunlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.581" end="02:00.444">Not a care in the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.444" end="02:04.084">Counting stars in the moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.084" end="02:09.818">Never felt this way about a girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.818" end="02:17.767">You showed me how to love with every single touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.767" end="02:25.767">Showed me everything I've never seen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.550" end="02:28.769">It feels like a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.769" end="02:30.888">And I don't want to wake up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.888" end="02:34.712">I just want to stay here next to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.712" end="02:41.995">It's hard to believe that I found someone that loves just like I do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.995" end="02:43.495">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.400" end="02:45.717">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.717" end="02:47.488">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.488" end="02:49.931">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.931" end="02:51.562">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.562" end="02:53.938">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.938" end="02:55.650">Don't wake me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.650" end="02:59.650">Oh, don't wake me up baby,</p></div></body></tt>